# Address of the FastAPI incident triage service, as reachable from the browser.
#
# Local development (console and service on the same machine):
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
#
# Hosted deployments: set this to your own publicly reachable HTTPS address, e.g.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://cybersecurity-incident-triage-backend-2.onrender.com
#
# No public address is hard-coded in the application. Resolution order at runtime:
#   1. the address saved on the Settings page (per browser)
#   2. VITE_API_BASE_URL from the build environment
#   3. http://127.0.0.1:8000 (valid only when the console runs locally)
#
# The FastAPI service must also allow this site's origin. Set ALLOWED_ORIGINS on
# the service (comma-separated) to the console's address before starting it.
